"""M16 RED: minimal reviewed, sanitized Experiment A aggregate fixture.

Only two 92-record validation curves and five boolean declarations are retained.
The Test CSV is the seven numeric columns verified during the pilot. No weights,
source paths, full configuration, raw examples or credentials are copied.
These are reported aggregates, not independent recomputation from predictions.
CI creates only temporary fixture files and never accesses experiment-pilot.
"""
